WEBVTT

00:11:28.089 --> 00:11:32.957
and hope that they will find their skills
and their courage

00:11:32.981 --> 00:11:34.644
to use nonviolent struggle

00:11:34.668 --> 00:11:39.741
and thus fix at least a part of the mess
our generation is making in this world.

00:11:39.765 --> 00:11:40.828
Thank you.

00:11:40.852 --> 00:11:43.222
(Applause)